{"seq":1,"slug":"git-terminal-workflow","title":"Git 终端工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/modern-cli-ecosystem/terminal-workflows/git-terminal-workflow","wordCount":561,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"git-终端工作流\">Git 终端工作流</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Git 是开发者每天使用频率最高的工具之一，但其 CLI 界面对交互式操作并不友好。现代工具组合——delta（语法高亮 diff）、lazygit（全功能 Git TUI）、fzf（交互式选择器）——将 Git 体验从「记忆命令 + 阅读原始文本」升级为「可视化操作 + 即时预览」。本文构建一套完整的 Git 终端工作流，覆盖从日常 diff 查看到复杂 rebase 操作的所有场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"工具角色分工\">工具角色分工</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Git Terminal Workflow&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;delta&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;lazygit&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;fzf + git&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;diff pager: syntax highlight, side-by-side&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;full TUI: stage, commit, rebase, merge&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;interactive selectors: branch, commit, stash&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Git Terminal Workflow\"] --&gt; B[\"delta\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"lazygit\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"fzf + git\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"diff pager: syntax highlight, side-by-side\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"full TUI: stage, commit, rebase, merge\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"interactive selectors: branch, commit, stash\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>替代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>delta</td>\n<td>Git pager（diff 美化）</td>\n<td>替代 less 查看 diff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lazygit</td>\n<td>Git TUI（全功能界面）</td>\n<td>替代逐条 git 命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fzf 函数</td>\n<td>交互式选择器</td>\n<td>替代手动输入分支/commit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"delta-配置详解\">delta 配置详解</h3><p>delta 作为 Git pager，让 <code>git diff</code>、<code>git log -p</code>、<code>git show</code> 的输出从纯文本变为带语法高亮的现代视图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# ~/.gitconfig — delta 完整配置&#10;[core]&#10;    pager = delta&#10;&#10;[interactive]&#10;    diffFilter = delta --color-only&#10;&#10;[delta]&#10;    navigate = true           # 用 n/N 跳转 diff 段落&#10;    side-by-side = true       # 并排对比视图&#10;    line-numbers = true       # 显示行号&#10;    syntax-theme = TwoDark    # 语法高亮主题&#10;    file-style = bold yellow ul&#10;    file-decoration-style = none&#10;    hunk-header-decoration-style = cyan box ul&#10;    minus-style = syntax &quot;#3f1919&quot;&#10;    plus-style = syntax &quot;#1a3a1a&quot;&#10;    line-numbers-minus-style = &quot;#b5483f&quot;&#10;    line-numbers-plus-style = &quot;#3fb551&quot;&#10;&#10;[merge]&#10;    conflictstyle = diff3&#10;&#10;[diff]&#10;    colorMoved = default\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.gitconfig — delta 完整配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[core]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pager = delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[interactive]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    diffFilter = delta --color-only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[delta]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    navigate = true           # 用 n/N 跳转 diff 段落</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    side-by-side = true       # 并排对比视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    line-numbers = true       # 显示行号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    syntax-theme = TwoDark    # 语法高亮主题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    file-style = bold yellow ul</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    file-decoration-style = none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hunk-header-decoration-style = cyan box ul</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    minus-style = syntax \"#3f1919\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plus-style = syntax \"#1a3a1a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    line-numbers-minus-style = \"#b5483f\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    line-numbers-plus-style = \"#3fb551\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[merge]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    conflictstyle = diff3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[diff]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    colorMoved = default</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"lazygit-核心操作\">lazygit 核心操作</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;brew install lazygit&#10;&#10;# 启动（在 git 仓库中）&#10;lazygit&#10;# 或简写&#10;lg  # alias lg=&#39;lazygit&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lazygit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启动（在 git 仓库中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lazygit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或简写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lg</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # alias lg='lazygit'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>lazygit 关键快捷键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面板</th>\n<th>按键</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件</td>\n<td><code>space</code></td>\n<td>stage/unstage 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件</td>\n<td><code>a</code></td>\n<td>stage/unstage 全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件</td>\n<td><code>c</code></td>\n<td>commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件</td>\n<td><code>d</code></td>\n<td>查看 diff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支</td>\n<td><code>n</code></td>\n<td>新建分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支</td>\n<td><code>space</code></td>\n<td>checkout 分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支</td>\n<td><code>M</code></td>\n<td>merge 到当前分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td><code>s</code></td>\n<td>squash 到上一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td><code>r</code></td>\n<td>reword 提交信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td><code>g</code></td>\n<td>reset 到此提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td><code>p</code></td>\n<td>push</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td><code>P</code></td>\n<td>pull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td><code>?</code></td>\n<td>帮助</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fzf-git-函数库\">fzf Git 函数库</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Git 分支切换（fzf 交互式）&#10;gco() {&#10;  local branch&#10;  branch=$(git branch --all --format=&#39;%(refname:short)&#39; |&#10;    grep -v HEAD |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;git log --oneline --graph --color=always -20 {}&#39; \\&#10;        --header &#39;Checkout branch&#39;) &amp;&amp;&#10;  git checkout &quot;$branch&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Git 提交浏览&#10;glog() {&#10;  git log --oneline --color=always --graph |&#10;    fzf --ansi --no-sort --reverse \\&#10;        --preview &#39;git show --color=always {1}&#39; \\&#10;        --preview-window &#39;right:60%&#39; \\&#10;        --bind &#39;enter:become(git show --color=always {1} | delta)&#39; \\&#10;        --bind &#39;ctrl-y:execute-silent(echo {1} | pbcopy)+abort&#39; \\&#10;        --header &#39;ENTER=show | Ctrl-Y=copy hash&#39;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Git stash 管理&#10;gstash() {&#10;  git stash list |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;git stash show -p --color=always {1}&#39; \\&#10;        --delimiter : \\&#10;        --bind &#39;enter:become(git stash pop {1})&#39; \\&#10;        --bind &#39;ctrl-d:execute(git stash drop {1})+reload(git stash list)&#39; \\&#10;        --bind &#39;ctrl-a:become(git stash apply {1})&#39; \\&#10;        --header &#39;ENTER=pop | Ctrl-D=drop | Ctrl-A=apply&#39;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Git add 交互式（选择性 stage）&#10;gadd() {&#10;  git diff --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR |&#10;    fzf --multi \\&#10;        --preview &#39;git diff --color=always -- {}&#39; \\&#10;        --preview-window &#39;right:70%&#39; \\&#10;        --header &#39;Select files to stage (TAB=multi)&#39; |&#10;    xargs -r git add&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Git 查看变更文件并编辑&#10;gdiff() {&#10;  git diff --name-only |&#10;    fzf --preview &#39;git diff --color=always -- {}&#39; \\&#10;        --preview-window &#39;right:70%&#39; \\&#10;        --bind &#39;enter:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {})&#39;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git 分支切换（fzf 交互式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gco</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  branch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%(refname:short)'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'git log --oneline --graph --color=always -20 {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Checkout branch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$branch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git 提交浏览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">glog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --color=always</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ansi</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --reverse</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'git show --color=always {1}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --preview-window</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'right:60%'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'enter:become(git show --color=always {1} | delta)'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-y:execute-silent(echo {1} | pbcopy)+abort'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ENTER=show | Ctrl-Y=copy hash'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git stash 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gstash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'git stash show -p --color=always {1}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --delimiter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'enter:become(git stash pop {1})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-d:execute(git stash drop {1})+reload(git stash list)'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-a:become(git stash apply {1})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --header</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ENTER=pop | Ctrl-D=drop | Ctrl-A=apply'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git add 交互式（选择性 stage）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#