B392F0\">gdiff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name-only</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'git diff --color=always -- {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --preview-window</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'right:70%'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'enter:become(${EDITOR:-vim} {})'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"delta-高级用法\">delta 高级用法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 单独使用 delta（不通过 git）&#10;diff file1.py file2.py | delta                  # 两文件对比&#10;delta file1.py file2.py                         # 直接对比&#10;&#10;# 控制 delta 输出模式&#10;git diff --stat                                  # 文件级变更统计&#10;git diff | delta --side-by-side --width 200     # 临时开宽屏并排&#10;git diff | delta --line-numbers-left-format=&quot;&quot;  # 隐藏左侧行号&#10;&#10;# delta 与 grep 结合&#10;git log -p --color=always | delta | rg &quot;function&quot;  # 在 diff 中搜索&#10;&#10;# 查看特定提交的完整变更&#10;git show abc123 | delta --side-by-side&#10;&#10;# 对比两个分支&#10;git diff main..feature | delta\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"backgrou